sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor C as Customer
  participant W as Website (WooCommerce + extension)
  participant R as Stock + slot services
  participant G as Payment gateway
  C->>W: Start checkout
  W->>W: Re-price cart on server, start 15-min price lock
  C->>W: Address and delivery slot
  W->>R: Service-area check, atomic slot hold
  W->>R: Atomic stock reservation for all lines
  R-->>W: Reservations Active (own expiry timers)
  C->>W: Choose payment method, place order
  W->>W: Lock valid? Reservations active? Create order + payment attempt (idempotency key)
  W->>G: Create payment for the exact snapshot amount
  C->>G: Pays
  G-->>C: Redirect back (NOT proof of payment)
  G->>W: Signed server-to-server callback
  W->>W: Verify signature, idempotency, amount
  alt Verified success
    W->>R: Confirm stock + slot reservations
    W-->>C: Order confirmed (notifications sent asynchronously)
  else Confirmed failure
    W->>R: Release reservations
    W-->>C: Payment failed — retry creates a new attempt
  else No definitive result
    W->>G: Server status lookup
    W-->>C: "Payment being verified — do not pay again"
  end
